Derived files (src/scope.c, src/scope.h, src/wave.c, src/wave.h, src/ui.c,
src/ui.h, src/gfx.c, src/gfx.h, src/font.h, src/splash.h, and the boot logo):

  - Hardware abstraction removed: STM32F4 HAL calls were replaced with RP2040
    (Pico SDK) equivalents.
  - ADC timebase reworked: timer-triggered ADC plus DMA was replaced by RP2040
    hardware free-run sampling with a programmed clock divider, FIFO, and DMA.
  - Display driver changed from ST7735 128x160 to ST7789 240x240.
  - UI layout redesigned for the 240x240 panel.
  - drawFastHLine/drawFastVLine off-by-one corrected; drawBitmap takes an
    explicit stride.
  - printf replaced with printInt for on-screen output.
